# Class talk. Specialization names are checked against the world database (docs/bot-voices,
# research brief section 5). Reputations are period knowledge. New writing.

# ---------------- Albion ----------------
@kind ambient
@topic class
@realm alb
@who *
@class Armsman
polearm or two handed? i keep going back and forth
armsman life: stand in front, get hit, be happy
nothing feels better than a big polearm style landing
@class Paladin
chant twisting is harder than it looks
paladin endurance chant, the group's best friend
@class Mercenary
dual wield merc, more swings more fun
merc tip: evade is your friend, train it
@class Reaver
flex is weird at first but the reach is nice
soulrending feels like cheating sometimes
still figuring out reaver, anyone have advice?
@class Scout
longbow and patience, that is the whole class
people complain about scout range, they should try aiming
@class Infiltrator
quiet night, just me and my envenom
crit strike or envenom first, cant decide
@class Minstrel
minstrel speed song, my gift to the realm
charm a pet, play a song, collect compliments
@class Cleric
smite cleric or rejuv, the eternal question
cleric life: heal, rez, get blamed, repeat
@class Friar
staff friar here, i heal and i hit, both badly some nights
nobody expects the friar to tank
@class Wizard
fire wizard, i solve problems from far away
earth or fire, every wizard argues about it
@class Theurgist
theurg pets everywhere, sorry about the lag
wind theurg, the art of throwing pets at things
@class Sorcerer
mez, pet, nap. sorc life
mind sorc tip: mez first, ask questions later
@class Cabalist
cabalist dots stack up nicely if you are patient
my simulacrum takes more hits than i do, as intended
@class Necromancer
necro tip: the pet is you, you are the pet
painworking necro, the slow kill is the best kill

# ---------------- Midgard ----------------
@kind ambient
@topic class
@realm mid
@who *
@class Warrior
warrior: shield up, face first, no regrets
throwing weapons on a warrior, more useful than it sounds
@class Thane
stormcalling thane, i bring the thunder
thane life: half caster, half tank, all fun
@class Skald
skald speed is the best gift in midgard
battlesongs up, everyone run faster
@class Berserker
zerker, two axes, no plan
left axe zerker, the berserk style never gets old
@class Savage
savage buffs cost me health but look at those numbers
hand to hand savage, punching things since level 5
@class Hunter
hunter and pet, best duo in the realm
composite bow at range, spear up close, i like options
@class Shadowblade
shadowblade, stealthed and waiting
envenom and patience, that is the whole job
@class Healer
pac healer here, mez on demand
mending healer, keeping groups alive since forever
healer life: everyone loves you until the group wipes
@class Shaman
cave shaman, diseases and dots, it is a lifestyle
mending shaman, the group's quiet backbone
@class Runemaster
runemaster damage is no joke when it lands
darkness or suppression rm? asking for my build
@class Spiritmaster
spiritmaster pet is tankier than half my groups
summoning sm, i let the spirit do the talking
@class Bonedancer
bonedancer army ready, three pets and a dream
bone army bd, the pet that commands pets

# ---------------- Hibernia ----------------
@kind ambient
@topic class
@realm hib
@who *
@class Hero
hero tank, celtic spear and a stubborn streak
large weapons hero, slow swings big hits
@class Champion
champion debuffs make everyone else look good
valor champ, the unsung hero of every group
@class Blademaster
blademaster, celtic dual, two blades, no thoughts
@class Warden
warden, the healer who can also take a hit
regrowth warden here, i keep the tank up
@class Druid
druid pet and heals, i am a small army
nature druid, i let the pet tank while i heal
@class Bard
bard speed, bard heals, bard mez. bards do it all
music bard here, twisting songs like a pro, mostly
@class Ranger
ranger, recurve bow, pathfinding, nature friend
celtic dual ranger, surprised people when i come out swinging
@class Nightshade
nightshade, critical strike and a lot of waiting
ns life: hide, wait, strike, run
@class Eldritch
void eld, the big numbers hibernia is proud of
light eld here, bright and painful
@class Enchanter
enchanter pet and pbaoe, everything in range dies
enchantments line, the buffs everyone wants
@class Mentalist
mentalist, heals and mez in one robe
mana ment, damage and a bit of everything
@class Animist
animist shrooms everywhere, please do not step on them
creeping path animist, the forest fights for me
@class Valewalker
valewalker, scythe in hand, still learning it
arboreal path vw, nobody knows what i do until i do it
